LegacySource Notice
-------------------

The modern .NET/WPF application, release scripts, GitHub workflows, and
migration documentation outside LegacySource are covered by the MIT License
above.

LegacySource preserves the original VB6-era GTA SA Control Center source, data,
and help material for migration reference. The original bundled readme/help text
describes that project as open source. Files in LegacySource remain subject to
any original author notices present in that folder.

Compiled legacy executables, installer packages, binary dumps, and zip backups
are intentionally excluded from this public source repository.
